 "description": "Audit one signing request (native:<id>): the evidence recomputed on every call \u2014 the hash chain re-verified (events are the chain only: sequence, type, time and hashes), every stored artifact re-read and re-hashed (per-artifact verified), and the RFC 3161 timestamp token re-verified against the executed PDF. Never returns an IP address, user agent, email address, field value or storage path. Requires agreements:read AND agreements_audit:read. Requires the agreements family flag and the agreements_native rollout; denials carry details.reason (AGENT_SURFACE_DISABLED, AGREEMENTS_DISABLED, TENANT_ACCESS_DENIED).",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
